    "media:imagetext": "MAZATIAN NA\nCOLONIAL CITY ON THE BEACH\nMéXICO\nA WORLD OF ITS OWN\nThe pearl of the Pacific\nMake Mazatlán your next destination and you can survey\n12 miles of golden sand beaches from atop a paddleboard\nor dig in to Las Labradas, a museum of archaeological\ncarvings, sculptures and 1,500 years of history. After that,\ntake a swing on an award-winning golf course or cast out\non a deep-sea fishing expedition.\nWhen you book with United Vacations® you get more\nthan all-inclusive. You're guaranteed end-to-end service.\n24-hour customer care and the best prices on United\nAirlines® flights. This is Mexico as it was meant to\nbe experienced\nVisit unitedvacations.com to learn more and book.\nUNITED\nVacations",
